# Homepage

Preserve a crawlable SSR guest `/`: one H1, SEO metadata, real landing data, Latest Signups, approved avatars only, CMS footer, guest performance.

- Do not reintroduce `app-surfaces.css` or heavy app providers/stores onto guest `/`.
- Homepage Community Blog is the real Blog system (`/blog`), not Custom Pages.
- Tasks that are **not** HOMEPAGE must not edit these files unless fixing a proven shared regression.
- Guard: `npm run test:guard:homepage`.
